{
  "info": {
    "name": "ICONZ 10 — Registration",
    "_postman_id": "iconz10-registration",
    "description": "Two APIs, and the requests used to work out why registrations are not arriving.\n\n**SIMBA** is where a registration is meant to land. It answers HTTP 200 to everything — refusals included — and puts the real verdict in `status_code`. Every request here therefore asserts on `status_code`, not on the HTTP status. A green tick in Postman's status column means nothing on its own.\n\n**Site** is the conference site's own endpoint, which validates a submission and then hands it to SIMBA.\n\nSet `key` before running anything — it is a credential and is deliberately left blank here rather than committed to the repository.\n\nEach run mints a fresh name, e-mail and phone number, so a refusal can never be put down to duplicate data.\n\nAs of 1 September 2026 the four SIMBA requests answer 403 'Data exist or failed', including the control built from BAZNAS's own example — and SIMBA's own admin interface refuses the same event with 406. The three controls below are what rules out the key, the payload and the field values as the cause.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "simbaUrl",
      "value": "https://demo-simba.baznas.or.id/api/ajax_event_register_peserta"
    },
    {
      "key": "siteUrl",
      "value": "https://icons-jet.vercel.app"
    },
    {
      "key": "key",
      "value": "",
      "description": "SIMBA API key. A credential — paste it here, do not commit it."
    },
    {
      "key": "org",
      "value": "3171100"
    },
    {
      "key": "eventId",
      "value": "128",
      "description": "128 = The 10th ICONZ. The 116 in the original example is a different demo event."
    },
    {
      "key": "spcId",
      "value": "5"
    },
    {
      "key": "institusi",
      "value": "28"
    },
    {
      "key": "jenis",
      "value": "2"
    },
    {
      "key": "unique",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "SIMBA",
      "description": "The committee's event register, called exactly as the site calls it.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register a participant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// A fresh identity each run, so a refusal can never be blamed on",
                  "// duplicate data.",
                  "const n = Date.now().toString().slice(-8);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('unique', n);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// SIMBA answers HTTP 200 to everything, refusals included. The verdict",
                  "// lives in status_code, so that is what is asserted.",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log(body);",
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('SIMBA accepted it (status_code 100/200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(String(body.status_code)).to.be.oneOf(['100', '200']);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "org",
                  "value": "{{org}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "key",
                  "value": "{{key}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "id_event",
                  "value": "{{eventId}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "nama",
                  "value": "Mr. Uji Integrasi {{unique}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "hp",
                  "value": "0812{{unique}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
